      "article_id": "article_022bc630cc2a6320",
      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "To address those challenges, NVIDIA today announced the NVIDIA Omniverse Blueprint for smart city AI , a reference framework that combines the NVIDIA Omniverse , Cosmos , NeMo and Metropolis platforms to bring the benefits of physical AI to entire cities and their critical infrastructure.",
